{"id": "swebq0198", "pool": "swebq", "arm": "aggressive", "tier": "aggressive", "lang": "en", "run_id": "ttfa1", "attempt": 1, "seed": 3881501288, "protocol": "ttfa-v3", "config_sha256": "8c3af78f4533df26d66383d6216ec5cacb9faa8bb324f3d6a6d51641beeea3a9", "gate_art_sha256": "0e6494c2eeac9bcd86c10b5def3cbd32e98bb0765fa2fd8afc8c1b47915ea372", "threshold": 0.5533501505851746, "gpu": "NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3", "host": "modal", "shard": 5, "query": "what celebrities has brody jenner dated?", "input_path": "/data/bench_audio/swebq0198.wav", "input_sha256": "7ea1d4e9c8aa4f1d8670234d52f09534dc2f5aedaca3e44b4b7ffe87bdee9a11", "input_samples": 42335, "input_s": 2.646, "n_real_chunks": 3, "score": 0.8712, "act": 0.9993, "is_info": true, "fired": true, "mode": "escalated", "answer": "", "relay_text": "Brody Jenner’s publicly reported celebrity dating history includes: Kristin Cavallari — dated around 2005–2006. (glamour.com) , Nicole Richie — briefly dated in 2006. (glamour.com) , Lauren Conrad — portrayed as a romance on The Hills, though both later suggested it was largely/factually fake for TV. (glamour.com) , Cora Skinner — model; dated in 2008. (glamour.com) , Jayde Nicole — Playboy.", "expert_answer": "Brody Jenner’s publicly reported celebrity dating history includes:\n\n- **Kristin Cavallari** — dated around 2005–2006. ([glamour.com](https://www.glamour.com/story/brody-jenner-ex-girlfriends))\n- **Nicole Richie** — briefly dated in 2006. ([glamour.com](https://www.glamour.com/story/brody-jenner-ex-girlfriends))\n- **Lauren Conrad** — portrayed as a romance on *The Hills*, though both later suggested it was largely/factually fake for TV. ([glamour.com](https://www.glamour.com/story/brody-jenner-ex-girlfriends))\n- **Cora Skinner** — model; dated in 2008. ([glamour.com](https://www.glamour.com/story/brody-jenner-ex-girlfriends))\n- **Jayde Nicole** — Playboy Playmate; dated 2008–2009. ([glamour.com](https://www.glamour.com/story/brody-jenner-ex-girlfriends))\n- **Avril Lavigne** — dated 2010–2012. ([glamour.com](https://www.glamour.com/story/brody-jenner-ex-girlfriends))\n- **Bryana Holly** — model; dated in 2013. ([glamour.com](https://www.glamour.com/story/brody-jenner-ex-girlfriends))\n- **Kaitlynn Carter** — dated from 2014 to 2019; they had a Bali ceremony in 2018 but were reportedly not legally married. ([lifeandstylemag.com](https://www.lifeandstylemag.com/posts/brody-jenner-dating-history-ex-wife-ex-girlfriends-more/))\n- **Josie Canseco** — model; brief fling in 2019. ([lifeandstylemag.com](https://www.lifeandstylemag.com/posts/brody-jenner-dating-history-ex-wife-ex-girlfriends-more/))\n- **Allison Mason** — model; brief romance reported in 2019. ([lifeandstylemag.com](https://www.lifeandstylemag.com/posts/brody-jenner-dating-history-ex-wife-ex-girlfriends-more/))\n- **Audrina Patridge** — romance rumors/kiss on *The Hills: New Beginnings*, but reportedly never became a real relationship. ([lifeandstylemag.com](https://www.lifeandstylemag.com/posts/brody-jenner-dating-history-ex-wife-ex-girlfriends-more/))\n- **Tia Blanco** — professional surfer; began dating in 2022, got engaged in 2023, and married in July 2025. ([lifeandstylemag.com](https://www.lifeandstylemag.com/posts/brody-jenner-dating-history-ex-wife-ex-girlfriends-more/))\n\nHe has also been **rumored** to have had flings with **Paris Hilton** and **Haylie Duff**, but those are less firmly documented. ([glamour.com](https://www.glamour.com/story/brody-jenner-ex-girlfriends))", "transcript": "What celebrities has Brody Jenner dated?\n", "asr_s": 0.55, "expert_s": 14.51, "expert_input_samples": 42335, "expert_input_s": 2.646, "expert_input_sha256": "7ea1d4e9c8aa4f1d8670234d52f09534dc2f5aedaca3e44b4b7ffe87bdee9a11", "expert_timed_out": false, "wait_s": 8.031, "relay_synth_ms": 17644, "onset_chunk": 3, "eot_seen": false, "n_speak_chunks": 7, "feed_lag_max_ms": 1013, "feed_lag_sum_ms": 3011, "audio_files": {"relay": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/swebq/audio/swebq0198_ag